  m_text: "Setup: Both players start with 1 on each hand.\r\n\r\nMove: On your turn,
    add one opponent's hand value to one of your own.\r\n\r\nThe Rule of 8:\r\n   
    Sum = 8: Hand is removed.\r\n    Sum > 7: Hand resets to 1.\r\n    Sum < 8: Hand
    keeps the total.\r\n\r\nWin: Be the first to remove both hands!"
